step The Insane Ghoul
  tip The Insane Ghoul hides in the small crypt by the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery, south of Darkshire. Calor's Nightbane Vile Fangs and Tainted Ones (level 29-31) roam the woods around it: they come at the end of this guide, a level later.
