step Vul'Gol Ogre Mound: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip Head south-west from Darkshire to the ogre mound. Abercrombie's Crate sits in the camp at its entrance; Splinter Fist ogres guard it. Zzarc' Vul is inside the ogre mound's cave: go in by the cave mouth on the mound's west side.
  collect 1349 quest 134 @33.4,76.3 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Abercrombie's Crate

step Defias Strongbox
  tip The Defias camp lies in the south-west of Duskwood, south of Raven Hill near the Westfall border. The strongbox stands among the tents.
  collect 5947 quest 1244 @23.9,72.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Defias Docket; inside

