step Raven Hill Cemetery: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip The Plague Spreaders walk the northern half of the Raven Hill Cemetery. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  tip Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders hold the west part of the cemetery, just east of Sven's camp.
  tip Careful: The skeletons in the catacombs are packed close together, so you can easily pull extra mobs.
  kill 604 quest 58 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Plague Spreader
  kill 785 quest 323 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Skeletal Warder
  kill 1110 quest 323 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Skeletal Raider
  kill 787 quest 323 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Skeletal Healer

step The Weathered Grave
  tip The grave stands among the skeletons at the cemetery's north-west corner, on the way to Sven. Its quest and the next are talk-only, to Sirra Von'Indi and Commander Althea in Darkshire: level 35 quests, but no fight.
  accept 225 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- A Weathered Grave

